py with <41>gemcitabine</41> and <42>capecitabine</42> and has completed <43>six full cycles</43>.    She's been on <44>surveillance</44>. She comes back today for follow-up with a <45>CT scan</45>.    She feels good. She is on <46>supplemental vitamin</46> *****. Her <47>blood sugars</47> have been more elevated and she has had a change in her
