n: <40>Negative (tumor is 19 cm from margin)</40>. - Pancreatic parenchymal margin: <41>Negative (tumor is 3.2 cm from margin)</41>. - Uncinate (retroperitoneal) margin: <42>Negative (tumor is 2.5 cm from margin)</42>. - <43>Bile duct</43>
