ner_results: ```plaintext
<1>pulmonary nodule</1> noted in <2>December 2013</2>, was noted to increase to <3>1.3 cm</3>. This <4>pulmonary nodule</4> was spiculated and located in the <5>left lung apex</5>. Otherwise, there was postsurgical changes with soft tissue and stranding within the <6>celiac artery</6> and <7>pancreatectomy resection beds</7> which had increased from <8>11/28/2012</8> but unchanged from <9>12/23/2013</9>. This was thought to reflect posttreatment changes. <10>CA 19-9 level</10> has continued to stay in the normal range. On <11>08/30/2014</11>, <12>pulmonary lesion</12> in the <13>peri fissural left lower lobe</13> was biopsied via <14>CT guidance</14>. During that examination, the <15>nodule</15> was noted to be <16>1.6x1.4 cm</16>. Pathology showed <17>adenocarcinoma</17>, consistent with metastasis from ***** ***** (IHC positive for <18>CK7</18> with patchy focal expression of *****; negative for ***** and <19>TTF-1</19>).
``` 
