ner_results: ```plaintext
<1>5000 cGy</1> (out of <2>5000 cGy</2>) to the <3>LLL</3> and <4>2500 cGy</4> out of <5>2500 cGy</5> to the ***** metastatic lesions, with *****. 02/14/15 <6>PET/CT</6>: New hypermetabolic <7>1.6 x 1.9 cm mesenteric lesion</7> with surrounding stranding suspicious for <8>metastasis</8>. Interval decrease in the size and metabolic activity of the metastatic nodules in the <9>left upper and lower lobe</9>, reflecting response to the recently completed <10>stereotactic ablative radiotherapy</10>. Benign post radiation changes. 03/28/15: <11>CT A/P</11> showed increase in the size of the <12>mesenteric nodule</12> along with further increase in <13>CA 19-9 level</13>. Subsequently seen by Dr. ***** ***** at ***** for consideration of *****-***** <14>pancreatic cancer trial</14> but was found to be ineligible due to low <15>IGF-1 level</15>, which was part of screening eligibility. 05/10/2015: Started <16>Gemcitabine</16> + <17>Abraxane</17> 06/27/2015: Restaging <18>CT</18> indicates stable disease in <19>lungs</19> but progression in enlarging <20>mesenteric nodule</20>. His <21>CA 19-9</21> continued to trend down and so patient was continued on <22>Gemcitabine</22>/<23>Abraxane</23>. 08/15/2015: <24>CT</24> indicates stable disease. <25>Abraxane</25> d/c due to worsening <26>peripheral neuropathy</26>. 11/14/15: <27>CT scan</27> shows stable disease.
``` 
