urns today to discuss that. He's had a follow-up <41>CT scan</41>.    He can continues to feel quite well. He does have some <42>right upper quadrant discomfort</42> which he manages with <43>ibuprofen</43>. He has residual <44>low-grade neuropathy</44> in his feet but it is exacerbated by <45>cold temperature</45>.    He has had <46>germ line testing</46> and is 
