33>  <34>degenerative disc disease</34>  <35>osteoarthritis</35>  bilateral <36>macular degeneration</36>    PRIOR SURGERIES:  <37>C-section</37> x2  <38>partial cystectomy</38> secondary to <39>endometriosis</39>, 1970    INJURIES:  None reported    CURRENT MEDICATIONS:  No 
