 further recovery from <47>surgery</47> and above-noted postoperative complications.  - 07/22/2020: Recovered adequately to begin <48>chemotherapy</48> with single-agent <49>gemcitabine</49> ***** three-week-on, one-week-off dosing schedule. - 09/30/2020: Interval <50>re-imaging</50>: Increased size of multiple scattered <51>pulmonary nodules</51>, up to <52>1 cm</52> in size, suspicious for <53>metastatic disease</53>; no change in
