50 lb weight loss in total  - Some <1>constipation</1>, uses <2>Colace</2> regularly.  - Some <3>urinary retention</3> as well  - <4>Pain</4> primarily in <5>sacral region</5>; on combination of <6>MSO4</6> and <7>Percocet</7>. ***** <8>insomnia</8>.  - No <9>jaundice</9>  - No <10>fevers</10>, <11>night sweats</11>  - No <12>cough</12>/<13>SOB</13>  - No pre-existing <14>peripheral sensory neuropathy</14>  - No worsening <15>glycemic control</15> since <16>cancer</16> diagnosis  - No frank <17>depression</17>/<18>psychosis</18>    The remainder of a full review of systems was negative.    Past medical history  1. <19>Non-insulin-dependent diabetes mellitus</19>.  2. <20>Hypertension</20>.  3. <21>Hyperlipidemia</21>.      Medications the patient states to be taking prior to today's encounter.   Medication Sig    <22>aspirin</22> 81 mg EC tablet Take by mouth Daily.    <23>atorvastatin</23> (<24>LIPITOR</24>) 20 mg tablet Take 20 mg by mouth Daily.    <25>glyBURIDE</25> (<26>DIABETA</26>) 5 mg tablet Take 5 mg by mouth Daily.    <27>lisinopril</27> (<28>PRINIVIL</28>,<29>ZESTRIL</29>) 2.5 mg tablet Take 2.5 mg by mouth Daily.    <30>metFORMIN</30> (<31>GLUCOPHAGE</31>) 1,000 mg tablet Take 1,000 mg by mouth 2 (two) times daily.    <32>morphine</32> (*****) 15 mg tablet Take 15 mg by mouth every 4 (four) hours as needed for <33>Pain</33>.    <34>omeprazole</34> (<35>PRILOSEC</35>) 20 mg capsule Take 20 mg by mouth Daily.    <36>ondansetron</36> (<37>ZOFRAN</37>) 4 mg tablet Take 8 mg by mouth daily as needed for <38>Nausea</38>.    <39>oxyCODONE-acetaminophen</39> (<40>PERCOCET</40>) 10-325 mg tablet Take 1 tablet by mouth every 4 (four) hours as needed for <41>Pain</41>.    <42>sitaGLIPtin</42> (<43>JANUVIA</43>) 100 mg tablet Take 100 mg by mouth Daily.
