onitor treatment response with monthly <35>CA 19-9 levels</35> and restaging <36>CT scans</36> every 2 months. He will need baseline <37>CT chest</37>, <38>abdomen</38> and <39>pelvis with contrast</39> prior to initiation of <40>chemotherapy</40>. We will also obtain baseline <41>labs</41> including <42>CBC</42> with
