oattenuation pancreatic uncinate process tumor</39> with involvement of the <40>celiac axis</40>, <41>superior mesenteric artery</41> and <42>portal vein</42>.    Patient was presented at ***** ***** <43>tumor board</43>. Recommendation was ***** <44>chemo</44>.     09/25/19: Consultation with Dr. *****. Recommendations: His 
