rease in density of the now solid <48>nodule</48> within the <49>left upper lobe</49> with increasing adjacent <50>groundglass</50>. The differential diagnosis includes <51>recurrent disease</51> versus evolution of changes related to prior <52>radiation therapy</52> (which was completed in October 2016) although recurrent disease is favored. Recommend continued attention on follow-up imaging. Unchanged 8 mm <53>groundglass nodule</53>
