 MEDICAL HISTORY: See below MEDICAL ILLNESSES: He has had <30>diabetes</30> for <31>2 years</31> and became <32>insulin-dependent</32> a <33>year ago</33>. He's had <34>hypertension</34> since <35>1996</35>.
