grees to proceed with standard <38>chemotherapy</38>, we will monitor treatment response with monthly <39>CA 19-9 levels</39> and <40>restaging CT scans</40> every 2 months (next scan tentatively scheduled for March).       #Supportive care: He is on <41>Ambien</41> for 
