use of <36>lithium</36>    PRIOR SURGERIES:  <37>Hysterectomy with bilateral salpingo-oophorectomy and tumor debulking</37>, 2015  <38>cholecystectomy</38>, mid 1990s for <39>gallstones</39>  <40>tonsillectomy</40>, age 5  <41>parathyroid nodules resected</41>, approximately 
