12/07/16: <1>CT cap</1> - No evidence of intrathoracic metastatic disease. Postsurgical changes status post <2>distal pancreatectomy</2> and <3>splenectomy</3>, including a small fluid collection anterior to the pancreatic head. Mildly enlarged <4>gastrohepatic lymph node</4> and fat stranding at the resection bed, nonspecific in the recently postoperative setting. 

12/22/16: <5>C1D1 of gemcitabine + capecitabine</5> 

01/13/17: <6>gemcitabine + capecitabine</6> 

02/03/17: <7>gemcitabine + capecitabine</7> 

02/24/17: <8>gemcitabine + capecitabine</8> 

02/28/17: Established care with Dr. ***** and started <9>120 mg sq</9> 

03/03/17: <10>gemcitabine + capecitabine</10> not given due to low <11>ANC</11> (<12>0.2</12>) 

03/15/17: <13>CT CAP</13>: No evidence of disease recurrence. 

03/17/17: <14>gemcitabine + capecitabine</14> 

03/24/17: <15>gemcitabine + capecitabine</15> 

03/28/17: <16>Lupron 22.5 mg IM</16> 

04/07/17: <17>gemcitabine + capecitabine</17> 

04/14/17: <18>gemcitabine + capecitabine</18> CANCELLED (due to <19>ANC</19> <20>0.58</20>), <21>120 mg sq x 3</21> 

04/21/17: <22>gemcitabine + capecitabine</22> (no ***** between days February 15 of cycle) 

04/28/17: <23>gemcitabine + capecitabine</23> DEFERRED (due to <24>ANC</24> <25>0.86</25>), <26>120 mg sq x 3</26> 

05/05/17: <27>gemcitabine + capecitabine</27> 

Interim History He had <28>neck pain</28> and <29>joint pain</29> in the <30>LE</30> after the last cycle. He took <31>Claritin</31> and <32>ibuprofen</32> and this helped. He has lower energy after the <33>infusion</33>. His appetite is good and he denies any weight loss. His <34>BM</34> are regular. His libido is lower. He is planning on <35>prostatectomy</35> in early September.
