height 188 cm (6' 2.02"), weight 76.5 kg (168 lb 9.6 oz), SpO2 100 %.    General appearance: No acute distress, conversant, appropriately interactive. Non-toxic, well-appearing.   Eyes: <1>anicteric sclerae</1>, <2>moist conjunctivae</2>; no <3>lid lag</3>.  HEENT: <4>Atraumatic</4>; <5>oropharynx clear</5> with <6>moist mucous membranes</6> and no <7>mucosal ulcerations</7>; normal <8>hard and soft palate</8>  Neck: <9>Full range of motion</9>, <10>supple</10>, no <11>lymphadenopathy</11>  Lungs/respiratory: <12>Clear to auscultation</12>, with <13>normal respiratory effort</13> and no <14>intercostal retractions</14>  Cardiovascular: <15>RRR</15>, <16>normal S1 S2</16>, no <17>murmurs</17>, <18>gallops</18>, or <19>rubs</19>.  Abdomen/GI: <20>Soft</20>, <21>non-tender</21>, <22>nondistended</22>; no <23>masses</23>, <24>ascites</24>, or <25>hepatomegaly</25>. <26>Tympanitic to percussion</26>.  Back: No <27>point spinal tenderness</27>.  Extremities: No <28>peripheral edema</28> or <29>discoloration</29> palpated or visualized.  Skin: <30>Normal temperature</30>, <31>turgor</31> and <32>texture</32>; <33>faint erythematous dry rash</33> on <34>cheeks</34>  Neuro: <35>Normal bulk</35>, <36>tone</36>, and <37>strength</37> in <38>upper and lower extremities</38>. <39>Intact gait</39>. No <40>focal sensorimotor deficits</40>.  Psych: <41>Appropriate affect</41>, <42>alert</42> and <43>oriented</43>.
