</34>, 4.5 cm, extending beyond the pancreas and present at <35>uncinate margin</35>; see comment. 2. <36>Metastatic adenocarcinoma</36> in one of eleven <37>lymph nodes</37> (January 05). 3. <38>Chronic</38>
