sue diagnosis at *****, and then <34>neoadjuvant chemotherapy</34> followed by <35>surgical resection</35>.    On 04/03/18 a <36>pancreatic protocol CT A/P</36> showed a 1.9 cm mildly hypodense <37>mass in the pancreatic head</37>, with less than 180 degrees
