<3>albuterol 90 mcg/actuation metered dose inhaler</3> 2 puffs, <4>Inhalation</4>, Every 4 Hours PRN 
<5>azithromycin (ZITHROMAX) 500 mg</5>, <6>Oral</6>, Three Times Weekly (Monday, Wednesday, Friday) 
<7>budesonide-formoteroL (SYMBICORT) 80-4.5 mcg/actuation inhaler</7> 2 puffs, <8>Inhalation</8>, 2 Times Daily Scheduled 
<9>dexAMETHasone (DECADRON) 4 mg tablet</9> Take 2 tabs <10>po</10> BID for 2 days after <11>chemo</11>; then 1 tab <12>po</12> BID for 2 days; then stop. 
<13>dicyclomine (BENTYL) 20 mg</13>, <14>Oral</14>, Every 6 Hours PRN 
<15>docusate sodium (COLACE) 250 mg</15>, <16>Oral</16>, 2 Times Daily Scheduled 
<17>dornase alfa (PULMOZYME) 2.5 mg</17>, <18>Inhalation</18>, 2 times daily 
<19>famotidine (PEPCID) 40 mg</19>, <20>Oral</20>, 2 Times Daily Scheduled 
<21>fluticasone propionate (FLONASE) 50 mcg/actuation nasal spray</21> 1 spray, <22>Nasal</22>, 3 Times Daily Scheduled 
<23>hypertonic nasal wash SOLN</23> by <24>Nasal route</24>. 7% 
<25>levoFLOXacin (LEVAQUIN) 750 mg</25>, <26>Oral</26>, Daily Scheduled 
<27>levothyroxine (SYNTHROID, LEVOTHROID) 88 mcg</27>, <28>Oral</28>, Daily Scheduled 
<29>lidocaine-prilocaine (EMLA) 2.5-2.5 % cream</29> Apply cream one hour before port access as needed for <30>pain</30>. 
<31>lipase/protease/amylase (PANCRELIPASE ORAL)</31> <32>Oral</32> 
<33>loperamide (IMODIUM) 2 mg capsule</33> Take two capsules by mouth at the onset of <34>diarrhea</34>, then take one capsule every 2 hours until diarrhea-free for 12 hours.
