n, <54>90 degree contact</54> with <55>superior mesenteric vein</55>, no definite evidence of <56>metastatic disease</56> in <57>chest</57>. 05/11/2016: <58>ERCP</58> - Narrowing and mild oozing of blood from <59>biliary tree</59> on cannulation suggested <60>tumor ingrowth</60>. <61>10 mm x 4 cm</61> ***** fully covered <62>biliary stent</62> placed across <63>stricture</63>, within prior placed <64>uncovered metal stent</64>. 05/17/2016: <65>Cycle 8, Day 1</65> *****
