en some time to line this up as they were initially uncomfortable with going to ***** and now have elected to come to <42>UCSF</42>. She saw the <43>radiation oncologist</43>, there was some concern about <44>metastatic disease</44>. A <45>PET/CT scan</45> was done and this was indeterminate for <46>metastatic disease</46>. She 
